  {
   "name": "capability",
   "description": "Turn on a group of tools you need but do not currently have. Call it with no argument to see what is available, or with a name to switch that group on: browser, computer-use, chrome, personal, web-research, generation, svg, diagram, chart, math, office, 3d, connectors. The tools join your list from your NEXT reply onward — they are not callable in the same reply that turns them on. Turn on only what the task actually needs.",
   "promptSnippet": "Turn on a group of tools (browser, computer-use, personal, …)",
   "parameters": "{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"name\":{\"description\":\"The capability to turn on: browser, computer-use, chrome, personal, web-research, generation, svg, diagram, chart, math, office, 3d, connectors. Omit to list them.\",\"type\":\"string\"}}}"
  },
  {
   "name": "chart",
   "description": "Draw a data visual — bar, stacked, horizontal bar, line, area, scatter, donut, pie or radar — from the numbers, straight into the chat as an interactive card (hover reads the values, a chart/table toggle, Open in canvas). Every request to chart, plot, graph or visualise data goes here: sales by year, shares of a total, a trend, a comparison of two series. It draws in under a second from the labels and values you pass; put the real numbers in, never a summary of them. Every chart has a LOOK: name one that fits the subject (--look), set the knobs (--palette, --accent, --radius, --bars, --grid, --line, --font), or --from_image a picture to take its colours; left alone, it wears the conversation's look. Never image generation for a chart (a painting cannot put a value on an axis), never matplotlib, never hand-written SVG, never a whole deck for one chart. It writes a .svg (and the spec beside it) into the project, so the same chart can go into a page or document. To change a chart afterwards, use chart_edit.",
   "promptSnippet": "chart: an interactive chart of data in the chat (bar, line, donut, …), with a look",
   "parameters": "{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"type\",\"title\"],\"properties\":{\"type\":{\"description\":\"Which chart: bar (values by category), stacked (parts of each category), hbar (ranked names, long labels), line (a trend), area, scatter (x/y points), donut (shares of a whole), pie (the same, no hole), radar (several measures on spokes — a profile, ratings). Left out: bar (line for many points).\",\"cliOptional\":true,\"anyOf\":[{\"const\":\"bar\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"stacked\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"hbar\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"line\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"area\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"scatter\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"donut\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"pie\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"radar\",\"type\":\"string\"}]},\"title\":{\"description\":\"The chart title, e.g. \\\"Units Sold by Year\\\".\",\"cliOptional\":true,\"type\":\"string\"},\"labels\":{\"description\":\"The categories (x axis), comma-separated: \\\"2021, 2022, 2023, 2024\\\". For scatter, the x values.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"values\":{\"description\":\"The values in the same order: \\\"12, 19, 15, 22\\\". Several series: \\\"Revenue: 4.2, 5.1, 6.4; Cost: 3.1, 3.4, 3.9\\\".\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"unit\":{\"description\":\"The unit of the values: \\\"$\\\", \\\"%\\\", \\\"GW\\\", \\\"units\\\".\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"subtitle\":{\"description\":\"A line under the title: the population, the period.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"x_label\":{\"description\":\"Axis title for the categories.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"y_label\":{\"description\":\"Axis title for the values.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"highlight\":{\"description\":\"One label to single out (its bar or slice takes the accent).\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"note\":{\"description\":\"A source line under the chart: \\\"Source: Q3 report\\\".\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"data\":{\"description\":\"Instead of labels/values: the whole spec as JSON — {\\\"series\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"…\\\",\\\"points\\\":[{\\\"label\\\":\\\"…\\\",\\\"value\\\":1}]}]}, or [{\\\"label\\\":\\\"…\\\",\\\"value\\\":1}, …].\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"look\":{\"description\":\"A named look. Pick one that fits the subject: clean — the everyday one — the app blue, a thin grid, gently rounded bars; soft — muted, dusty colours, pill bars, a dotted grid, smooth lines — friendly and quiet; bold — saturated colours, no grid, values on every bar, a heavy title — for a headline number; mono — one hue in tints with a single warm accent — for rankings and one-series bars; editorial — serif titles, a muted navy/terracotta/olive palette, hairline grid — reports, the press; ocean — deep blues to teal with a sand accent, smooth lines and a gradient under them; forest — greens and bark with a copper accent — nature, sustainability, growth; sunset — coral to amber to rose, pill bars, no grid — warm and loud; candy — pink, tangerine, mint, sky — pill bars, rounded type, values on — playful; slate — its own charcoal ground with bright cyan/lime/amber — a dashboard tile, in any theme; paper — cream ground, ink lines, serif — a chart from a book. Left out, the chart wears the conversation's look.\",\"anyOf\":[{\"const\":\"clean\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"soft\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"bold\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"mono\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"editorial\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"ocean\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"forest\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"sunset\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"candy\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"slate\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"paper\",\"type\":\"string\"}]},\"palette\":{\"description\":\"Series colours, comma-separated hex or names: \\\"#264653, #2a9d8f, #e9c46a\\\" or \\\"navy, coral, teal\\\". Overrides the look's.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"accent\":{\"description\":\"The highlight colour (hex or a name like coral, amber).\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"radius\":{\"description\":\"Bar corners: a number of px (0 = square), or \\\"pill\\\" (fully rounded).\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"bars\":{\"description\":\"Bar thickness: \\\"thin\\\", \\\"wide\\\", or a fraction of the band like 0.4.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"grid\":{\"description\":\"Gridlines: lines, dots, or none.\",\"anyOf\":[{\"const\":\"lines\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"dots\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"none\",\"type\":\"string\"}]},\"line\":{\"description\":\"Line/area charts: straight, smooth (curved), or step.\",\"anyOf\":[{\"const\":\"straight\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"smooth\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"step\",\"type\":\"string\"}]},\"font\":{\"description\":\"The typeface: system, serif, mono, rounded.\",\"anyOf\":[{\"const\":\"system\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"serif\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"mono\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"rounded\",\"type\":\"string\"}]},\"value_labels\":{\"description\":\"Values written on the bars/points: on, off, or auto (only in the larger view).\",\"anyOf\":[{\"const\":\"on\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"off\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"auto\",\"type\":\"string\"}]},\"background\":{\"description\":\"A ground of the chart's own (hex): the card paints it in any theme; the ink is chosen for contrast.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"style\":{\"description\":\"Every knob at once as JSON: {\\\"look\\\":\\\"soft\\\",\\\"radius\\\":\\\"pill\\\",\\\"grid\\\":\\\"dots\\\",\\\"markers\\\":\\\"dot\\\",\\\"area\\\":\\\"gradient\\\",\\\"ring\\\":0.4}.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"from_image\":{\"description\":\"Style it like this picture: a path to an image whose colours (and ground) become the palette — a screenshot, a poster, a brand page.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"size\":{\"description\":\"Where the .svg is going: card — the chat and web pages, 960×560; doc — a document column, 640×400; slide — a 16:9 slide, 1280×720, type 1.5×; square — a square tile, 800×800. Default card.\",\"anyOf\":[{\"const\":\"card\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"doc\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"slide\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"square\",\"type\":\"string\"}]},\"out\":{\"description\":\"Where to write the .svg, e.g. charts/units.svg. Relative paths land in the project. Default: named from the title, in the project.\",\"type\":\"string\"}}}"
  },
  {
   "name": "chart_edit",
   "description": "Change a chart that exists (its .svg or .chart.json): its data — add a series for comparison (--add \"Cost: 8, 12, 10, 14\"), change one value (--set \"2023: 17\"), remove a series (--remove Cost), replace the labels or values — its words (title, subtitle, unit, note, highlight, axis titles), its type, or its look (--look, --palette, --accent, --radius, --bars thin, --grid none, --line smooth, --font serif, --value_labels on, --background, --from_image). Every request to change a chart in any way — a colour, thinner bars, a second bar per year, a different style, \"make it look like this picture\" — is one call here; the chart is redrawn in place and shown again. Nothing else about it changes.",
   "promptSnippet": "chart_edit: change an existing chart — data, words, or look",
   "parameters": "{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"file\"],\"properties\":{\"file\":{\"description\":\"The chart to change: its .svg (or .chart.json) path, as the chart tool reported it.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"add\":{\"description\":\"A series to add, in the labels' order: \\\"Cost: 8, 12, 10, 14\\\" (several: \\\"A: 1, 2; B: 3, 4\\\"). Turns a bar chart into grouped bars.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"set\":{\"description\":\"Change values by label: \\\"2023: 17\\\" or \\\"2023: 17, 2024: 25\\\". For several series: \\\"Cost/2023: 9\\\".\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"remove\":{\"description\":\"A series to remove by name (or a label to drop from every series).\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"rename\":{\"description\":\"Rename a series or a label: \\\"old: new\\\" (several: \\\"a: b; c: d\\\").\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"sort\":{\"description\":\"Order the categories by value (a ranking), or leave them as given.\",\"anyOf\":[{\"const\":\"asc\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"desc\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"none\",\"type\":\"string\"}]},\"type\":{\"description\":\"A different kind of chart: bar (values by category), stacked (parts of each category), hbar (ranked names, long labels), line (a trend), area, scatter (x/y points), donut (shares of a whole), pie (the same, no hole), radar (several measures on spokes — a profile, ratings).\",\"anyOf\":[{\"const\":\"bar\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"stacked\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"hbar\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"line\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"area\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"scatter\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"donut\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"pie\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"radar\",\"type\":\"string\"}]},\"title\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"subtitle\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"labels\":{\"description\":\"Replace the categories: \\\"Q1, Q2, Q3, Q4\\\".\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"values\":{\"description\":\"Replace ALL the data: \\\"1, 2, 3\\\" or \\\"A: 1, 2; B: 3, 4\\\".\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"unit\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"x_label\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"y_label\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"highlight\":{\"description\":\"The label to single out, or \\\"none\\\".\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"note\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"look\":{\"description\":\"A named look. Pick one that fits the subject: clean — the everyday one — the app blue, a thin grid, gently rounded bars; soft — muted, dusty colours, pill bars, a dotted grid, smooth lines — friendly and quiet; bold — saturated colours, no grid, values on every bar, a heavy title — for a headline number; mono — one hue in tints with a single warm accent — for rankings and one-series bars; editorial — serif titles, a muted navy/terracotta/olive palette, hairline grid — reports, the press; ocean — deep blues to teal with a sand accent, smooth lines and a gradient under them; forest — greens and bark with a copper accent — nature, sustainability, growth; sunset — coral to amber to rose, pill bars, no grid — warm and loud; candy — pink, tangerine, mint, sky — pill bars, rounded type, values on — playful; slate — its own charcoal ground with bright cyan/lime/amber — a dashboard tile, in any theme; paper — cream ground, ink lines, serif — a chart from a book. Left out, the chart wears the conversation's look.\",\"anyOf\":[{\"const\":\"clean\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"soft\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"bold\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"mono\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"editorial\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"ocean\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"forest\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"sunset\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"candy\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"slate\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"paper\",\"type\":\"string\"}]},\"palette\":{\"description\":\"Series colours, comma-separated hex or names: \\\"#264653, #2a9d8f, #e9c46a\\\" or \\\"navy, coral, teal\\\". Overrides the look's.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"accent\":{\"description\":\"The highlight colour (hex or a name like coral, amber).\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"radius\":{\"description\":\"Bar corners: a number of px (0 = square), or \\\"pill\\\" (fully rounded).\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"bars\":{\"description\":\"Bar thickness: \\\"thin\\\", \\\"wide\\\", or a fraction of the band like 0.4.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"grid\":{\"description\":\"Gridlines: lines, dots, or none.\",\"anyOf\":[{\"const\":\"lines\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"dots\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"none\",\"type\":\"string\"}]},\"line\":{\"description\":\"Line/area charts: straight, smooth (curved), or step.\",\"anyOf\":[{\"const\":\"straight\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"smooth\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"step\",\"type\":\"string\"}]},\"font\":{\"description\":\"The typeface: system, serif, mono, rounded.\",\"anyOf\":[{\"const\":\"system\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"serif\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"mono\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"rounded\",\"type\":\"string\"}]},\"value_labels\":{\"description\":\"Values written on the bars/points: on, off, or auto (only in the larger view).\",\"anyOf\":[{\"const\":\"on\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"off\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"auto\",\"type\":\"string\"}]},\"background\":{\"description\":\"A ground of the chart's own (hex): the card paints it in any theme; the ink is chosen for contrast.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"style\":{\"description\":\"Every knob at once as JSON: {\\\"look\\\":\\\"soft\\\",\\\"radius\\\":\\\"pill\\\",\\\"grid\\\":\\\"dots\\\",\\\"markers\\\":\\\"dot\\\",\\\"area\\\":\\\"gradient\\\",\\\"ring\\\":0.4}.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"from_image\":{\"description\":\"Style it like this picture: a path to an image whose colours (and ground) become the palette — a screenshot, a poster, a brand page.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"size\":{\"description\":\"Where the .svg is going: card — the chat and web pages, 960×560; doc — a document column, 640×400; slide — a 16:9 slide, 1280×720, type 1.5×; square — a square tile, 800×800. Default card.\",\"anyOf\":[{\"const\":\"card\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"doc\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"slide\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"const\":\"square\",\"type\":\"string\"}]}}}"
  },
